3IcHCH4oBg",null,null,null,[2],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["想知道這道料理需要製作多久🙂\n一直以來不是第一次在中山店用餐\n等了20分鐘後問店員如果尚未製作可以取消沒關係，結果是還需要再等5-10分鐘，\n一道料理要等近30分鐘🤦🏼\u200d♀️\n\n匆匆上來後就覺得是非常趕的情況做出來的，並不是第一次吃這個料理肉甚至咬起來軟得很像沒有熟…青菜也很生\n可以理解忘記 那麼是不是可以跟客人說一下，\n或是夾帳單時告知這道菜得等近30分鐘\n真的覺得非常失望😞",null,[0,70]]]],[null,1777272192000000,1777272192000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfaXg0LUU4TVJpekE1RzN1U2d2a0Z4Zw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfaXg0LUU4TVJpekE1RzN1U2d2a0Z4ZxoSQ2dzSWdJdTh6d1lRMW9YTkZR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj7nLnMutKWAxXWa_UHHcfvOYgQ_2MIfygH"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14193162937581622681/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPVTJSR1ZuVllNSGh6VmpGVk0ySjZiR3RoTWtacFYxWk9NbUl4UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您選擇至一風堂中山店用餐，也謝謝您一直以來的支持。\n針對當日餐點讓您久候，且餐點呈現未能達到您的期待，我們致上最誠摯的歉意。若當日餐點製作時間較長，應於顧客點餐後即主動告知預估等候時間，以利您安排用餐節奏，很抱歉當日我們在服務細節上未能妥善做到。\n若您方便，希望您能透過客服信箱(iptw.se