ldaRUpTYlRsNldqSmFlRlJXUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您選擇至一風堂中山店用餐。當日提供的服務未能符合您的期待，影響您的用餐感受，我們在此向您致上誠摯的歉意。\n關於您提及的叉燒部分，想向您說明：切邊叉燒是取自整塊叉燒的頭尾兩端部位，因此口感相較一般叉燒會較有嚼勁。很遺憾此次的呈現與您的期待有所落差。\n同時，我們也會再次提醒同仁留意服務態度與現場應對，並確認人員的工作狀態，期望以更細緻與貼心的服務面對每一位顧客。\n感謝您願意與我們分享寶貴的用餐回饋，您的意見是我們持續進步的重要動力，誠摯期盼未來仍有機會再次為您服務。\n祝日安\n台灣一風堂 敬上 J",null,[0,134]]]],[null,null,7217,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWclh5MXNSVmQ2YUhKRWFWZEJSbTl6WjJaeFRWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4e536d4a45a0cbf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlVrXy1sRVd6aHJEaVdBRm9zZ2ZxTVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWclh5MXNSVmQ2YUhKRWFWZEJSbTl6WjJaeFRWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWclh5MXNSVmQ2YUhKRWFWZEJSbTl6WjJaeFRWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWclh5MXNSVmQ2YUhKRWFWZEJSbTl6WjJaeFRWRRILMGRfenlwbVA3aDkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVnJYeTFzUlZkNmFISkVhVmRCUm05eloyWnhUVkUSCzBkX3p5cG1QN2g5IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARvwxapNQ25QQqCzBkX3p5cG1QN2g5\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj7nLnMutKWAxXWa_UHHcfvOYgQoykIkQEoCg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj-08PMutKWAxWTdV4EHbtuA5MQ0pMFCDYoAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj7nLnMutKWAxXWa_UHHcfvOYgQ0pMFCIEBKAI"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoMmJ6ZEhOa0p1TFRKbU9XZFVWMjU1Y0d4V2VsRRAB",["0x0:0x4e536d4a45a0cbf",null,1766107299794166,1766107299794166,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115328996078342967421/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Frannie","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV28Pl5epINcpc6O-Km_jG3rXH6D_VDkOz1mWU5tDk9jDLiCp977w\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115328996078342967421?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"115328996078342967421",null,538,2348,null,[1,8,1],44,["在地嚮導 · 538 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwj7nLnMutKWAxXWa_UHHcfvOYgQpr8GCJMBKAA"]]]],null,"8 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",nul